source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The first candidate closes one rune of content and a word rune refuses it, so Jira gives the opener up instead of scanning on and renders the line literally; jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
*a*b*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*a*b*</p>
-- want.md --
\*a\*b\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
